('kinra-strength-three','training',1,'{"en":{"name":"Strength practice · 3 days","description":"Low-rep barbell practice with modest accessory work for adults already familiar with these lifts. No max testing.\n\nBegin below your recent working loads. Keep about 2 reps in reserve (RPE 8 maximum). Add one rep within the range first; increase the smallest load only when all sets meet the top with consistent technique. In week 4 reduce each main lift by one set, then resume only if recovered.\n\nAn original general adult example, not an individually assessed prescription. Review exercises and equipment first. Start with easy practice sets; stop for pain or feeling unwell. Schedule rest between hard sessions. Adjust or seek qualified guidance when health, pregnancy or injury affects exercise.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0035-back-squat-cucanj-sa-sipkom","name":"Back Squat (Čučanj sa šipkom)","sets":3,"reps":"4–6","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":8,"section":"main","notes":"Use a rack with correctly set safeties or a competent spotter where needed. Warm up with lighter practice sets before the working sets."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0060-bench-press-potisak-s-ravne-klupe","name":"Bench Press (Potisak s ravne klupe)","sets":3,"reps":"4–6","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":8,"section":"main","notes":"Use a rack with correctly set safeties or a competent spotter where needed. Warm up with lighter practice sets before the working sets."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0574-seated-cable-row-veslanje-na-sajli-sjedece","name":"Seated Cable Row (Veslanje na sajli — sjedeće)","sets":3,"reps":"6–8","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."}]},{"title":"B · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0169-conventional-deadlift-mrtvo-dizanje","name":"Conventional Deadlift (Mrtvo dizanje)","sets":2,"reps":"3–5","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":8,"section":"main","notes":"Use a rack with correctly set safeties or a competent spotter where needed. Warm up with lighter practice sets before the working sets."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0233-dumbbell-shoulder-press-sjedeci-potisak-bucicama","name":"Dumbbell Shoulder Press (Sjedeći potisak bučicama)","sets":3,"reps":"5–8","rest_seconds":150,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":3,"reps":"6–8","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."}]},{"title":"C · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0035-back-squat-cucanj-sa-sipkom","name":"Back Squat (Čučanj sa šipkom)","sets":3,"reps":"5–6","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a rack with correctly set safeties or a competent spotter where needed. Warm up with lighter practice sets before the working sets."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0060-bench-press-potisak-s-ravne-klupe","name":"Bench Press (Potisak s ravne klupe)","sets":3,"reps":"5–6","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a rack with correctly set safeties or a competent spotter where needed. Warm up with lighter practice sets before the working sets."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0152-chest-supported-row-veslanje-s-osloncem-na-prsa","name":"Chest Supported Row (Veslanje s osloncem na prsa)","sets":3,"reps":"6–10","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0582-seated-leg-curl-machine","name":"Seated Leg Curl (Machine)","sets":2,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Use a controlled range and steady breathing. Choose a load that leaves the stated effort in reserve."}]}]},"bs":{"name":"Vježbanje snage · 3 dana","description":"Vježbanje šipkom s manjim brojem ponavljanja i umjerenim dodacima za odrasle koji poznaju ove pokrete. Bez testiranja maksimuma.\n\nPočnite ispod nedavnih radnih opterećenja. Zadržite oko 2 ponavljanja u rezervi (najviše RPE 8). Prvo dodajte ponavljanje unutar raspona; najmanje opterećenje dodajte tek kada su sve serije na gornjoj granici uz dobru tehniku. U četvrtoj sedmici smanjite glavne vježbe za jednu seriju, pa nastavite kada se oporavite.\n\nOriginalni opći primjer za odrasle, bez individualne procjene. Prvo pregledajte vježbe i opremu. Počnite laganim probnim serijama; stanite kod bola ili lošeg osjećaja. Ostavite odmor između težih treninga. Prilagodite plan ili zatražite stručni savjet ako zdravlje, trudnoća ili povreda utiču na vježbanje.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0035-back-squat-cucanj-sa-sipkom","name":"Back Squat (Čučanj sa šipkom)","sets":3,"reps":"4–6","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":8,"section":"main","notes":"Po potrebi koristite stalak s pravilno postavljenim osiguračima ili sposobnog pomagača. Prije radnih serija uradite lakše probne serije."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0060-bench-press-potisak-s-ravne-klupe","name":"Bench Press (Potisak s ravne klupe)","sets":3,"reps":"4–6","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":8,"section":"main","notes":"Po potrebi koristite stalak s pravilno postavljenim osiguračima ili sposobnog pomagača. Prije radnih serija uradite lakše probne serije."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0574-seated-cable-row-veslanje-na-sajli-sjedece","name":"Seated Cable Row (Veslanje na sajli — sjedeće)","sets":3,"reps":"6–8","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."}]},{"title":"B · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0169-conventional-deadlift-mrtvo-dizanje","name":"Conventional Deadlift (Mrtvo dizanje)","sets":2,"reps":"3–5","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":8,"section":"main","notes":"Po potrebi koristite stalak s pravilno postavljenim osiguračima ili sposobnog pomagača. Prije radnih serija uradite lakše probne serije."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0233-dumbbell-shoulder-press-sjedeci-potisak-bucicama","name":"Dumbbell Shoulder Press (Sjedeći potisak bučicama)","sets":3,"reps":"5–8","rest_seconds":150,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0377-lat-pulldown-povlacenje-na-lat-masini","name":"Lat Pulldown (Povlačenje na lat mašini)","sets":3,"reps":"6–8","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."}]},{"title":"C · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0035-back-squat-cucanj-sa-sipkom","name":"Back Squat (Čučanj sa šipkom)","sets":3,"reps":"5–6","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Po potrebi koristite stalak s pravilno postavljenim osiguračima ili sposobnog pomagača. Prije radnih serija uradite lakše probne serije."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0060-bench-press-potisak-s-ravne-klupe","name":"Bench Press (Potisak s ravne klupe)","sets":3,"reps":"5–6","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Po potrebi koristite stalak s pravilno postavljenim osiguračima ili sposobnog pomagača. Prije radnih serija uradite lakše probne serije."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0152-chest-supported-row-veslanje-s-osloncem-na-prsa","name":"Chest Supported Row (Veslanje s osloncem na prsa)","sets":3,"reps":"6–10","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0582-seated-leg-curl-machine","name":"Seated Leg Curl (Machine)","sets":2,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Krećite se kontrolisano i dišite ravnomjerno. Odaberite opterećenje s rezervom prema zadanom naporu."}]}]},"de":{"name":"Kraftpraxis · 3 Tage","description":"Langhantelpraxis mit wenigen Wiederholungen und überschaubaren Zusatzübungen für Erwachsene mit Übungserfahrung. Keine Maximaltests.\n\nUnter den letzten Arbeitsgewichten beginnen. Etwa 2 Wiederholungen Reserve lassen (höchstens RPE 8). Zuerst Wiederholungen im Bereich ergänzen; das kleinste Gewicht erst erhöhen, wenn alle Sätze technisch konstant oben liegen. In Woche 4 bei jeder Hauptübung einen Satz weniger, danach bei ausreichender Erholung fortsetzen.\n\nEin eigenes allgemeines Beispiel für Erwachsene ohne individuelle Untersuchung. Übungen und Geräte zuerst prüfen. Mit leichten Übungssätzen beginnen; bei Schmerzen oder Unwohlsein stoppen. Zwischen schweren Einheiten Erholung einplanen. Bei gesundheitlichen Einschränkungen, Schwangerschaft oder Verletzung anpassen oder fachlichen Rat einholen.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0035-back-squat-cucanj-sa-sipkom","name":"Back Squat (Čučanj sa šipkom)","sets":3,"reps":"4–6","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":8,"section":"main","notes":"Bei Bedarf ein Rack mit passend eingestellten Sicherungen oder eine erfahrene Hilfsperson nutzen. Vor den Arbeitssätzen mit leichteren Übungssätzen aufwärmen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0060-bench-press-potisak-s-ravne-klupe","name":"Bench Press (Potisak s ravne klupe)","sets":3,"reps":"4–6","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":8,"section":"main","notes":"Bei Bedarf ein Rack mit passend eingestellten Sicherungen oder eine erfahrene Hilfsperson nutzen. Vor den Arbeitssätzen mit leichteren Übungssätzen aufwärmen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0574-seated-cable-row-veslanje-na-sajli-sjedece","name":"Seated Cable Row (Veslanje na sajli — sjedeće)","sets":3,"reps":"6–8","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."}]},{"title":"B · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0169-conventional-deadlift-mrtvo-dizanje","name":"Conventional Deadlift (Mrtvo dizanje)","sets":2,"reps":"3–5","rest_seconds":180,"rpe":8,"section":"main","notes":"Bei Bedarf ein Rack mit passend eingestellten Sicherungen oder eine erfahrene Hilfsperson nutzen. Vor den Arbeitssätzen mit leichteren Übungssätzen aufwärmen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0233-dumbbell-shoulder-press-sjedeci-potisak-bucicama","name":"Dumbbell Shoulder Press (Sjedeći potisak bučicama)","sets":3,"reps":"