r Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."}]},{"title":"B · Unterkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0393-leg-press-potisak-nogama","name":"Leg Press (Potisak nogama)","sets":3,"reps":"10–12","rest_seconds":120,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0582-seated-leg-curl-machine","name":"Seated Leg Curl (Machine)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0094-bulgarian-split-squat","name":"Bulgarian Split Squat","sets":2,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":90,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0679-standing-calf-raise-machine","name":"Standing Calf Raise (Machine)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0392-leg-extension-machine","name":"Leg Extension (Machine)","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Kontrollierter Bewegungsumfang und gleichmäßig atmen. Eine Last mit der vorgesehenen Belastungsreserve wählen."}]}]}}'::jsonb),
('kinra-mobility-practice','training',1,'{"en":{"name":"Comfortable movement · 3 days","description":"Short, repetition-based mobility practice for hips, shoulders and the upper back. General movement practice, with no injury-treatment claim.\n\nUse slow repetitions through a comfortable range, with no forced end positions. Over four weeks gradually improve control or comfortable range; do not add weight. These short sessions complement strength and aerobic activity rather than replace them.\n\nAn original general adult example, not an individually assessed prescription. Review exercises and equipment first. Start with easy practice sets; stop for pain or feeling unwell. Schedule rest between hard sessions. Adjust or seek qualified guidance when health, pregnancy or injury affects exercise.","weeks":4,"days":[{"title":"A · Hips and spine","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0143-cat-cow-macka-krava-aktivna-fleksija-ekstenzija-kicme","name":"Cat-Cow (Mačka-krava — aktivna fleksija/ekstenzija kičme)","sets":2,"reps":"6–8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"One slow movement cycle counts as one rep. Stay in a comfortable range; do not force a stretch."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0312-hip-circles-kruzenje-kukovima","name":"Hip Circles (Kruženje kukovima)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0242-dynamic-hip-flexor-lunge-dinamicki-lunge-za-hip-flexore","name":"Dynamic Hip Flexor Lunge (Dinamički lunge za hip flexore)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":4,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."}]},{"title":"B · Shoulders and upper back","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0027-arm-circles-kruzenje-rukama","name":"Arm Circles (Kruženje rukama)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"One slow movement cycle counts as one rep. Stay in a comfortable range; do not force a stretch."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0762-wall-slide-klizanje-uz-zid","name":"Wall Slide (Klizanje uz zid)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"One slow movement cycle counts as one rep. Stay in a comfortable range; do not force a stretch."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0583-seated-thoracic-rotation-sjedeca-torakalna-rotacija","name":"Seated Thoracic Rotation (Sjedeća torakalna rotacija)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":4,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."}]},{"title":"C · Whole-body movement","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0143-cat-cow-macka-krava-aktivna-fleksija-ekstenzija-kicme","name":"Cat-Cow (Mačka-krava — aktivna fleksija/ekstenzija kičme)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"One slow movement cycle counts as one rep. Stay in a comfortable range; do not force a stretch."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0667-squat-to-stand-cucanj-do-stajanja-mobilizacijska-sekvenca","name":"Squat To Stand (Čučanj do stajanja — mobilizacijska sekvenca)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"One slow movement cycle counts as one rep. Stay in a comfortable range; do not force a stretch."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0512-quadruped-thoracic-rotation-cetveronozna-torakalna-rotacija","name":"Quadruped Thoracic Rotation (Četveronožna torakalna rotacija)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0762-wall-slide-klizanje-uz-zid","name":"Wall Slide (Klizanje uz zid)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"One slow movement cycle counts as one rep. Stay in a comfortable range; do not force a stretch."}]}]},"bs":{"name":"Ugodno kretanje · 3 dana","description":"Kratke sesije mobilnosti kukova, ramena i gornjeg dijela leđa uz brojanje ponavljanja. Opće kretanje, bez tvrdnje o liječenju povrede.\n\nRadite sporo u ugodnom opsegu, bez forsiranja krajnjih položaja. Tokom četiri sedmice postepeno poboljšavajte kontrolu ili ugodan opseg; ne dodajte utege. Ove kratke sesije dopunjuju trening snage i aerobnu aktivnost.\n\nOriginalni opći primjer za odrasle, bez individualne procjene. Prvo pregledajte vježbe i opremu. Počnite laganim probnim serijama; stanite kod bola ili lošeg osjećaja. Ostavite odmor između težih treninga. Prilagodite plan ili zatražite stručni savjet ako zdravlje, trudnoća ili povreda utiču na vježbanje.","weeks":4,"days":[{"title":"A · Kukovi i kičma","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0143-cat-cow-macka-krava-aktivna-fleksija-ekstenzija-kicme","name":"Cat-Cow (Mačka-krava — aktivna fleksija/ekstenzija kičme)","sets":2,"reps":"6–8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Jedan spori ciklus pokreta je jedno ponavljanje. Ostanite u ugodnom opsegu; ne forsirajte istezanje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0312-hip-circles-kruzenje-kukovima","name":"Hip Circles (Kruženje kukovima)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0242-dynamic-hip-flexor-lunge-dinamicki-lunge-za-hip-flexore","name":"Dynamic Hip Flexor Lunge (Dinamički lunge za hip flexore)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":4,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."}]},{"title":"B · Ramena i gornja leđa","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0027-arm-circles-kruzenje-rukama","name":"Arm Circles (Kruženje rukama)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Jedan spori ciklus pokreta je jedno ponavljanje. Ostanite u ugodnom opsegu; ne forsirajte istezanje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0762-wall-slide-klizanje-uz-zid","name":"Wall Slide (Klizanje uz zid)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Jedan spori ciklus pokreta je jedno ponavljanje. Ostanite u ugodnom opsegu; ne forsirajte istezanje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0583-seated-thoracic-rotation-sjedeca-torakalna-rotacija","name":"Seated Thoracic Rotation (Sjedeća torakalna rotacija)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":4,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."}]},{"title":"C · Kretanje cijelog tijela","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0143-cat-cow-macka-krava-aktivna-fleksija-ekstenzija-kicme","name":"Cat-Cow (Mačka-krava — aktivna fleksija/ekstenzija kičme)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Jedan spori ciklus pokreta je jedno ponavljanje. Ostanite u ugodnom opsegu; ne forsirajte istezanje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0667-squat-to-stand-cucanj-do-stajanja-mobilizacijska-sekvenca","name":"Squat To Stand (Čučanj do stajanja — mobilizacijska sekvenca)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Jedan spori ciklus pokreta je jedno ponavljanje. Ostanite u ugodnom opsegu; ne forsirajte istezanje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0512-quadruped-thoracic-rotation-cetveronozna-torakalna-rotacija","name":"Quadruped Thoracic Rotation (Četveronožna torakalna rotacija)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0762-wall-slide-klizanje-uz-zid","name":"Wall Slide (Klizanje uz zid)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Jedan spori ciklus pokreta je jedno ponavljanje. Ostanite u ugodnom opsegu; ne forsirajte istezanje."}]}]},"de":{"name":"Angenehme Bewegung · 3 Tage","description":"Kurze Mobilitätspraxis für Hüfte, Schultern und oberen Rücken mit Wiederholungen. Allgemeine Bewegung ohne Anspruch auf Verletzungsbehandlung.\n\nLangsame Wiederholungen im angenehmen Bewegungsumfang ohne erzwungene Endpositionen. Über vier Wochen Kontrolle oder angenehmen Bewegungsumfang verbessern; kein Gewicht ergänzen. Diese kurzen Einheiten ergänzen Kraft- und Ausdauertraining.\n\nEin eigenes allgemeines Beispiel für Erwachsene ohne individuelle Untersuchung. Übungen und Geräte zuerst prüfen. Mit leichten Übungssätzen beginnen; bei Schmerzen oder Unwohlsein stoppen. Zwischen schweren Einheiten Erholung einplanen. Bei gesundheitlichen Einschränkungen, Schwangerschaft oder Verletzung anpassen oder fachlichen Rat einholen.","weeks":4,"days":[{"title":"A · Hüfte und Wirbelsäule","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0143-cat-cow-macka-krava-aktivna-fleksija-ekstenzija-kicme","name":"Cat-Cow (Mačka-krava — aktivna fleksija/ekstenzija kičme)","sets":2,"reps":"6–8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ein langsamer Bewegungszyklus zählt als Wiederholung. Im angenehmen Umfang bleiben; Dehnung nicht erzwingen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0312-hip-circles-kruzenje-kukovima","name":"Hip Circles (Kruženje kukovima)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0242-dynamic-hip-flexor-lunge-dinamicki-lunge-za-hip-flexore","name":"Dynamic Hip Flexor Lunge (Dinamički lunge za hip flexore)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":4,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."}]},{"title":"B · Schultern und oberer Rücken","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0027-arm-circles-kruzenje-rukama","name":"Arm Circles (Kruženje rukama)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ein langsamer Bewegungszyklus zählt als Wiederholung. Im angenehmen Umfang bleiben; Dehnung nicht erzwingen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0762-wall-slide-klizanje-uz-zid","name":"Wall Slide (Klizanje uz zid)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ein langsamer Bewegungszyklus zählt als Wiederholung. Im angenehmen Umfang bleiben; Dehnung nicht erzwingen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0583-seated-thoracic-rotation-sjedeca-torakalna-rotacija","name":"Seated Thoracic Rotation (Sjedeća torakalna rotacija)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":4,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."}]},{"title":"C · Ganzkörperbewegung","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0143-cat-cow-macka-krava-aktivna-fleksija-ekstenzija-kicme","name":"Cat-Cow (Mačka-krava — aktivna fleksija/ekstenzija kičme)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ein langsamer Bewegungszyklus zählt als Wiederholung. Im angenehmen Umfang bleiben; Dehnung nicht erzwingen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0667-squat-to-stand-cucanj-do-stajanja-mobilizacijska-sekvenca","name":"Squat To Stand (Čučanj do stajanja — mobilizacijska sekvenca)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ein langsamer Bewegungszyklus zählt als Wiederholung. Im angenehmen Umfang bleiben; Dehnung nicht erzwingen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0512-quadruped-thoracic-rotation-cetveronozna-torakalna-rotacija","name":"Quadruped Thoracic Rotation (Četveronožna torakalna rotacija)","sets":2,"reps":"6","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0762-wall-slide-klizanje-uz-zid","name":"Wall Slide (Klizanje uz zid)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":30,"rpe":3,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ein langsamer Bewegungszyklus zählt als Wiederholung. Im angenehmen Umfang bleiben; Dehnung nicht erzwingen."}]}]}}'::jsonb),
('kinra-hotel-travel','training',1,'{"en":{"name":"Travel reset · 2 days","description":"Two compact bodyweight sessions for travel. No doorframe, suitcase or furniture anchors required; pulling work is limited.\n\nRepeat the week with a rest day between sessions. Add one controlled rep per set up to the upper limit. Then use a slightly harder movement variation only after reviewing it, and restart at the lower limit. Keep 2–4 reps in reserve; extra speed is not progression.\n\nAn original general adult example, not an individually assessed prescription. Review exercises and equipment first. Start with easy practice sets; stop for pain or feeling unwell. Schedule rest between hard sessions. Adjust or seek qualified guidance when health, pregnancy or injury affects exercise.","weeks":2,"days":[{"title":"A · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0364-knee-push-up-skleka-s-koljenima","name":"Knee Push-Up (Skleka s koljenima)","sets":2,"reps":"6–12","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0282-glute-bridge-most-straznjice","name":"Glute Bridge (Most stražnjice)","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."}]},{"title":"B · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":2,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0760-wall-push-up-plus-skleka-uz-zid-s-protrakcijom-serratus","name":"Wall Push-Up Plus (Skleka uz zid s protrakcijom — serratus)","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0140-calf-raises-zagrijavanje-podizanje-na-prste-za-zagrijavanje","name":"Calf Raises — Zagrijavanje (Podizanje na prste za zagrijavanje)","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."}]}]},"bs":{"name":"Trening na putu · 2 dana","description":"Dva kratka treninga vlastitom težinom na putu. Bez vješanja o vrata, kofere ili namještaj; povlačenje je ograničeno.\n\nPonavljajte sedmicu uz dan odmora između treninga. Dodajte po jedno kontrolisano ponavljanje do gornje granice. Zatim, tek nakon pregleda, odaberite malo težu varijantu i počnite donjim brojem. Zadržite 2–4 ponavljanja u rezervi; veća brzina nije napredak.\n\nOriginalni opći primjer za odrasle, bez individualne procjene. Prvo pregledajte vježbe i opremu. Počnite laganim probnim serijama; stanite kod bola ili lošeg osjećaja. Ostavite odmor između težih treninga. Prilagodite plan ili zatražite stručni savjet ako zdravlje, trudnoća ili povreda utiču na vježbanje.","weeks":2,"days":[{"title":"A · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0364-knee-push-up-skleka-s-koljenima","name":"Knee Push-Up (Skleka s koljenima)","sets":2,"reps":"6–12","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0282-glute-bridge-most-straznjice","name":"Glute Bridge (Most stražnjice)","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."}]},{"title":"B · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":2,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0760-wall-push-up-plus-skleka-uz-zid-s-protrakcijom-serratus","name":"Wall Push-Up Plus (Skleka uz zid s protrakcijom — serratus)","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0140-calf-raises-zagrijavanje-podizanje-na-prste-za-zagrijavanje","name":"Calf Raises — Zagrijavanje (Podizanje na prste za zagrijavanje)","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."}]}]},"de":{"name":"Training unterwegs · 2 Tage","description":"Zwei kompakte Körpergewichtseinheiten auf Reisen. Keine Türrahmen-, Koffer- oder Möbelanker erforderlich; Zugübungen sind begrenzt.\n\nDie Woche mit einem Ruhetag zwischen Einheiten wiederholen. Kontrollierte Wiederholungen bis zur Obergrenze ergänzen. Danach erst nach Prüfung eine etwas schwierigere Variante wählen und unten beginnen. 2–4 Wiederholungen Reserve lassen; höheres Tempo ist kein Fortschrittskriterium.\n\nEin eigenes allgemeines Beispiel für Erwachsene ohne individuelle Untersuchung. Übungen und Geräte zuerst prüfen. Mit leichten Übungssätzen beginnen; bei Schmerzen oder Unwohlsein stoppen. Zwischen schweren Einheiten Erholung einplanen. Bei gesundheitlichen Einschränkungen, Schwangerschaft oder Verletzung anpassen oder fachlichen Rat einholen.","weeks":2,"days":[{"title":"A · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0364-knee-push-up-skleka-s-koljenima","name":"Knee Push-Up (Skleka s koljenima)","sets":2,"reps":"6–12","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0282-glute-bridge-most-straznjice","name":"Glute Bridge (Most stražnjice)","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0185-dead-bug-mrtva-buba","name":"Dead Bug (Mrtva buba)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."}]},{"title":"B · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":2,"reps":"8–10","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0760-wall-push-up-plus-skleka-uz-zid-s-protrakcijom-serratus","name":"Wall Push-Up Plus (Skleka uz zid s protrakcijom — serratus)","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0068-bird-dog-pas-koji-trazi-prticicu","name":"Bird Dog (Pas koji traži prtičicu)","sets":2,"reps":"8","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0140-calf-raises-zagrijavanje-podizanje-na-prste-za-zagrijavanje","name":"Calf Raises — Zagrijavanje (Podizanje na prste za zagrijavanje)","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":45,"rpe":5,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."}]}]}}'::jsonb),
('kinra-band-full-body','training',1,'{"en":{"name":"Band full body · 3 days","description":"Light portable resistance with a manufacturer-approved anchor. Alternate controlled leg, push and pull work.\n\nRepeat the listed week. Begin at the low end of each rep range with 3–4 reps in reserve (RPE 6–7). Add one rep per set when controlled; after every set reaches the top, increase the smallest available load and return to the low end. Do not increase load and sets together. If recovery or form worsens, repeat the previous week or remove one set.\n\nAn original general adult example, not an individually assessed prescription. Review exercises and equipment first. Start with easy practice sets; stop for pain or feeling unwell. Schedule rest between hard sessions. Adjust or seek qualified guidance when health, pregnancy or injury affects exercise.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0618-single-arm-resistance-band-lat-row","name":"Single Arm Resistance Band Lat Row","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0517-resistance-band-chest-fly","name":"Resistance Band Chest Fly","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0521-resistance-band-glute-bridge","name":"Resistance Band Glute Bridge","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0518-resistance-band-curl","name":"Resistance Band Curl","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."}]},{"title":"B · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Reps are per side. Complete both sides for one set; match the easier side and rest after both."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0525-resistance-band-lat-pulldown","name":"Resistance Band Lat Pulldown","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0364-knee-push-up-skleka-s-koljenima","name":"Knee Push-Up (Skleka s koljenima)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0528-resistance-band-leg-curl","name":"Resistance Band Leg Curl","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0527-resistance-band-lateral-raise","name":"Resistance Band Lateral Raise","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."}]},{"title":"C · Full body","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Bodyweight is the intended resistance; use a stable surface and a comfortable range. Stop before technique changes."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0618-single-arm-resistance-band-lat-row","name":"Single Arm Resistance Band Lat Row","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0517-resistance-band-chest-fly","name":"Resistance Band Chest Fly","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0521-resistance-band-glute-bridge","name":"Resistance Band Glute Bridge","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0533-resistance-band-triceps-pushdown","name":"Resistance Band Triceps Pushdown","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Inspect the band and secure the anchor as its manufacturer directs. Use controlled tension; never aim the band toward your face."}]}]},"bs":{"name":"Cijelo tijelo s trakom · 3 dana","description":"Lagani prenosivi otpor sa sidrom koje odobrava proizvođač. Smjenjujte kontrolisani rad za noge, potiske i povlačenja.\n\nPonavljajte prikazanu sedmicu. Počnite donjim brojem ponavljanja uz 3–4 ponavljanja u rezervi (RPE 6–7). Dodajte po jedno kontrolisano ponavljanje u seriji; kada sve serije dostignu gornju granicu, dodajte najmanje dostupno opterećenje i vratite se donjoj. Ne povećavajte istovremeno opterećenje i broj serija. Ako oporavak ili tehnika oslabe, ponovite prethodnu sedmicu ili uklonite jednu seriju.\n\nOriginalni opći primjer za odrasle, bez individualne procjene. Prvo pregledajte vježbe i opremu. Počnite laganim probnim serijama; stanite kod bola ili lošeg osjećaja. Ostavite odmor između težih treninga. Prilagodite plan ili zatražite stručni savjet ako zdravlje, trudnoća ili povreda utiču na vježbanje.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0618-single-arm-resistance-band-lat-row","name":"Single Arm Resistance Band Lat Row","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0517-resistance-band-chest-fly","name":"Resistance Band Chest Fly","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0521-resistance-band-glute-bridge","name":"Resistance Band Glute Bridge","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0518-resistance-band-curl","name":"Resistance Band Curl","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."}]},{"title":"B · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Ponavljanja su po strani. Obje strane čine jednu seriju; pratite slabiju stranu i odmorite nakon obje."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0525-resistance-band-lat-pulldown","name":"Resistance Band Lat Pulldown","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0364-knee-push-up-skleka-s-koljenima","name":"Knee Push-Up (Skleka s koljenima)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0528-resistance-band-leg-curl","name":"Resistance Band Leg Curl","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0527-resistance-band-lateral-raise","name":"Resistance Band Lateral Raise","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."}]},{"title":"C · Cijelo tijelo","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Otpor je vlastita tjelesna težina; koristite stabilnu podlogu i ugodan opseg. Stanite prije promjene tehnike."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0618-single-arm-resistance-band-lat-row","name":"Single Arm Resistance Band Lat Row","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0517-resistance-band-chest-fly","name":"Resistance Band Chest Fly","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0521-resistance-band-glute-bridge","name":"Resistance Band Glute Bridge","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0533-resistance-band-triceps-pushdown","name":"Resistance Band Triceps Pushdown","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Pregledajte traku i učvrstite sidro prema uputstvu proizvođača. Kontrolišite napetost; ne usmjeravajte traku prema licu."}]}]},"de":{"name":"Band-Ganzkörper · 3 Tage","description":"Leichter tragbarer Widerstand mit vom Hersteller geeignetem Anker. Kontrollierte Bein-, Druck- und Zugarbeit im Wechsel.\n\nDie angegebene Woche wiederholen. Am unteren Ende des Wiederholungsbereichs mit 3–4 Wiederholungen Reserve (RPE 6–7) beginnen. Bei guter Kontrolle eine Wiederholung pro Satz ergänzen; erreichen alle Sätze die Obergrenze, das kleinste verfügbare Gewicht hinzufügen und unten beginnen. Gewicht und Satzzahl nicht gleichzeitig erhöhen. Bei schlechterer Erholung oder Technik die Vorwoche wiederholen oder einen Satz streichen.\n\nEin eigenes allgemeines Beispiel für Erwachsene ohne individuelle Untersuchung. Übungen und Geräte zuerst prüfen. Mit leichten Übungssätzen beginnen; bei Schmerzen oder Unwohlsein stoppen. Zwischen schweren Einheiten Erholung einplanen. Bei gesundheitlichen Einschränkungen, Schwangerschaft oder Verletzung anpassen oder fachlichen Rat einholen.","weeks":6,"days":[{"title":"A · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0618-single-arm-resistance-band-lat-row","name":"Single Arm Resistance Band Lat Row","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Band prüfen und den Anker nach Herstellerangabe befestigen. Spannung kontrollieren; das Band nicht auf das Gesicht richten."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0517-resistance-band-chest-fly","name":"Resistance Band Chest Fly","sets":2,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Band prüfen und den Anker nach Herstellerangabe befestigen. Spannung kontrollieren; das Band nicht auf das Gesicht richten."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0521-resistance-band-glute-bridge","name":"Resistance Band Glute Bridge","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Band prüfen und den Anker nach Herstellerangabe befestigen. Spannung kontrollieren; das Band nicht auf das Gesicht richten."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0518-resistance-band-curl","name":"Resistance Band Curl","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Band prüfen und den Anker nach Herstellerangabe befestigen. Spannung kontrollieren; das Band nicht auf das Gesicht richten."}]},{"title":"B · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0542-reverse-lunge-iskorak-unazad","name":"Reverse Lunge (Iskorak unazad)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Wiederholungen pro Seite. Beide Seiten ergeben einen Satz; an der schwächeren Seite orientieren und danach pausieren."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0525-resistance-band-lat-pulldown","name":"Resistance Band Lat Pulldown","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Band prüfen und den Anker nach Herstellerangabe befestigen. Spannung kontrollieren; das Band nicht auf das Gesicht richten."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0364-knee-push-up-skleka-s-koljenima","name":"Knee Push-Up (Skleka s koljenima)","sets":2,"reps":"8–12","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0528-resistance-band-leg-curl","name":"Resistance Band Leg Curl","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Band prüfen und den Anker nach Herstellerangabe befestigen. Spannung kontrollieren; das Band nicht auf das Gesicht richten."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0527-resistance-band-lateral-raise","name":"Resistance Band Lateral Raise","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":6,"section":"main","notes":"Band prüfen und den Anker nach Herstellerangabe befestigen. Spannung kontrollieren; das Band nicht auf das Gesicht richten."}]},{"title":"C · Ganzkörper","exercises":[{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0071-bodyweight-squat-cucanj-s-tjelesnom-tezinom","name":"Bodyweight Squat (Čučanj s tjelesnom težinom)","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":60,"rpe":7,"section":"main","weight":0,"notes":"Das eigene Körpergewicht ist der Widerstand; eine stabile Fläche und angenehmen Umfang nutzen. Vor Technikverlust stoppen."},{"catalogue_id":"exercise-0618-single-arm-resistance-band-lat-row","name":"Single Arm Resistance Band Lat Row","sets":3,"reps":"12–15","rest_seconds":75,"rpe":7,"section":"main","notes":"Band prüfen und den Anker nach Herstellerangabe befestigen. Spannung kontrollieren; das Band nicht auf das Gesicht